---
// Field → AI use map for idea-ai-wiki "07 AI Readiness". Inline SVG inherits site fonts.
---
<figure class="fm">
  <div class="fm-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 506" role="img" aria-labelledby="fm-t fm-d"><title id="fm-t">What each authoring field lets the AI agent do</title><desc id="fm-d">Categories, asset types and keywords let the agent match a request to the right page (routing). Visibility and content type decide what the requester may see (answering). Numbered steps with warnings let it send back clear, ordered steps. The usage log shows authors where their page helped (tracking).</desc><text x="10" y="30" class="fm-h">AUTHORS FILL IN</text><text x="760" y="30" class="fm-h fm-ai">THE AI AGENT USES IT TO</text><rect x="10" y="60" width="330" height="38" rx="6" class="fm-field"/><text x="24" y="84" class="fm-name">Categories</text><text x="326" y="84" text-anchor="end" class="fm-sub">suggested from the title</text><rect x="10" y="106" width="330" height="38" rx="6" class="fm-field"/><text x="24" y="130" class="fm-name">Asset types</text><text x="326" y="130" text-anchor="end" class="fm-sub">picked from the asset list</text><rect x="10" y="152" width="330" height="38" rx="6" class="fm-field"/><text x="24" y="176" class="fm-name">Keywords</text><path d="M340 79.0 C 460 79.0, 640 125.0, 754 125.0" class="fm-link"/><path d="M340 125.0 C 460 125.0, 640 125.0, 754 125.0" class="fm-link"/><path d="M340 171.0 C 460 171.0, 640 125.0, 754 125.0" class="fm-link"/><rect x="760" y="103.0" width="400" height="44" rx="22" class="fm-use"/><text x="780" y="130.0" class="fm-usetext">Match a request to the right page</text><text x="1140" y="130.0" text-anchor="end" class="fm-tag">ROUTING</text><rect x="10" y="224" width="330" height="38" rx="6" class="fm-field"/><text x="24" y="248" class="fm-name">Visibility</text><text x="326" y="248" text-anchor="end" class="fm-sub">private · team · site</text><rect x="10" y="270" width="330" height="38" rx="6" class="fm-field"/><text x="24" y="294" class="fm-name">Content type</text><text x="326" y="294" text-anchor="end" class="fm-sub">help guide · policy · reference</text><path d="M340 243.0 C 460 243.0, 640 266.0, 754 266.0" class="fm-link"/><path d="M340 289.0 C 460 289.0, 640 266.0, 754 266.0" class="fm-link"/><rect x="760" y="244.0" width="400" height="44" rx="22" class="fm-use"/><text x="780" y="271.0" class="fm-usetext">Decide what the requester may see</text><text x="1140" y="271.0" text-anchor="end" class="fm-tag">ANSWERING</text><rect x="10" y="342" width="330" height="38" rx="6" class="fm-field"/><text x="24" y="366" class="fm-name">Steps</text><text x="326" y="366" text-anchor="end" class="fm-sub">with Warning and Verify</text><path d="M340 361.0 C 460 361.0, 640 361.0, 754 361.0" class="fm-link"/><rect x="760" y="339.0" width="400" height="44" rx="22" class="fm-use"/><text x="780" y="366.0" class="fm-usetext">Send back clear, ordered steps</text><text x="1140" y="366.0" text-anchor="end" class="fm-tag">ANSWERING</text><rect x="10" y="414" width="330" height="38" rx="6" class="fm-field"/><text x="24" y="438" class="fm-name">Usage log</text><text x="326" y="438" text-anchor="end" class="fm-sub">times used · last work order</text><path d="M340 433.0 C 460 433.0, 640 433.0, 754 433.0" class="fm-link"/><rect x="760" y="411.0" width="400" height="44" rx="22" class="fm-use"/><text x="780" y="438.0" class="fm-usetext">Show authors where their page helped</text><text x="1140" y="438.0" text-anchor="end" class="fm-tag">TRACKING</text></svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="fm-cap">Every field authors already fill in has a job for the AI.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .fm { margin: 0; }
  .fm-scroll { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  .fm svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 820px; height: auto; }
  .fm text { font-family: inherit; }
  /* Prefixed with .fm to outrank `.fm text` above. */
  .fm .fm-h, .fm .fm-tag { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .06em; fill: #6E6E6E; }
  .fm-h.fm-ai, .fm-tag { fill: var(--cs-accent-text); }
  .fm-field { fill: #F6F6F4; stroke: #E6E6E4; }
  .fm-name { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; fill: #111111; }
  .fm-sub { font-size: 13px; fill: #6E6E6E; }
  .fm-link { fill: none; stroke: var(--cs-accent); stroke-width: 1.25; opacity: .7; }
  .fm-use { fill: var(--cs-accent-tint); stroke: var(--cs-accent); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .fm-usetext { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; fill: #111111; }
  .fm-cap { margin-top: var(--space-caption); font-size: 14px; color: #6E6E6E; }
</style>
